TITLE
Brazilian Grocery Advertised Prices (sample)

WHAT IT CONTAINS
Store-level advertised prices for the state of Sao Paulo, three months, in Parquet and CSV:
prices (capture time, GTIN, store, price, regular price, promotion flag, currency, unit price,
source URL), products (GTIN, name, brand, category, size) and stores (chain, unit, city, state,
country). Comes with a data card: method, column dictionary, freshness and honest
limits. No images, no retailer descriptions, no personal data.

